<%- include('_partials/head', { pageStyles: ['/css/kurukoo-public-pages.css?v=4','/css/kurukoo-discover.css?v=1'] }) %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>

<main class="frontend-discover-page">
  <section class="frontend-discover container" aria-labelledby="discover-title">
    <header class="frontend-discover__header">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Explore</span><h1 id="discover-title">Discover</h1><p>Find insights across the sources you connect.</p></div>
      <form class="frontend-discover__search" role="search" action="/discover" method="get"><label class="sr-only" for="discover-search">Search topics, documents and decisions</label><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#discover"></use></svg><input id="discover-search" name="q" type="search" placeholder="Search topics, documents, decisions…" autocomplete="off"></form>
    </header>
    <div class="frontend-discover__workspace">
      <aside class="frontend-discover__rail" aria-label="Discover filters">
        <div class="frontend-discover__rail-title"><strong>Refine</strong><button type="reset" form="discover-filter-form">Clear all</button></div>
        <form id="discover-filter-form" class="frontend-discover__filters" action="/discover" method="get">
          <fieldset><legend>Source</legend><label><input id="source-google-drive" type="checkbox" name="source" value="google-drive"><span>Google Drive</span><small>124</small></label><label><input id="source-google-sheets" type="checkbox" name="source" value="google-sheets"><span>Google Sheets</span><small>48</small></label><label><input id="source-notion" type="checkbox" name="source" value="notion"><span>Notion</span><small>32</small></label><label><input id="source-outlook" type="checkbox" name="source" value="outlook"><span>Outlook</span><small>16</small></label><button class="frontend-discover__more" type="button" aria-expanded="false">⌄&nbsp; Show more</button></fieldset>
          <fieldset><legend>Date</legend><div class="frontend-discover__select"><label class="sr-only" for="discover-date">Date range</label><select id="discover-date" name="date"><option>Any time</option><option>Past week</option><option>Past month</option></select></div></fieldset>
          <fieldset><legend>People</legend><div class="frontend-discover__people"><label class="sr-only" for="discover-people">Search people</label><input id="discover-people" type="search" name="people" placeholder="Search people…"></div></fieldset>
        </form>
      </aside>
      <section class="frontend-discover__results" aria-label="Connected source results">
        <div class="frontend-discover__toolbar"><div class="frontend-discover__chips" role="list" aria-label="Content types"><button class="is-active" type="button" role="listitem" aria-pressed="true">All</button><button type="button" role="listitem" aria-pressed="false">Documents</button><button type="button" role="listitem" aria-pressed="false">Spreadsheets</button><button type="button" role="listitem" aria-pressed="false">Notes</button><button type="button" role="listitem" aria-pressed="false">Presentations</button></div><label class="frontend-discover__sort" for="discover-sort"><span>Sort:</span><select id="discover-sort" name="sort"><option>Relevance</option><option>Recently updated</option><option>Recently added</option></select></label></div>
        <div class="frontend-discover__cards"><article class="frontend-source-card"><div class="frontend-source-card__top"><span class="frontend-source-card__file frontend-source-card__file--doc" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#document"></use></svg></span><span>May 14 · Google Docs</span></div><h2>Q2 Project Brief</h2><p>Project goals, scope, stakeholders, and success metrics.</p><footer><span>Document</span><strong>••• +2</strong></footer></article><article class="frontend-source-card"><div class="frontend-source-card__top"><span class="frontend-source-card__file frontend-source-card__file--sheet" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#list"></use></svg></span><span>May 14 · Google Sheets</span></div><h2>Risk Register (Current)</h2><p>Live risks, owners, status, and mitigation plans.</p><footer><span>Spreadsheet</span><strong>••• +3</strong></footer></article><article class="frontend-source-card"><div class="frontend-source-card__top"><span class="frontend-source-card__file frontend-source-card__file--note" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#note"></use></svg></span><span>May 13 · Notion</span></div><h2>Decisions Log — May 13</h2><p>Key decisions, rationale, and follow-up owners.</p><footer><span>Note</span><strong>••• +1</strong></footer></article><article class="frontend-source-card"><div class="frontend-source-card__top"><span class="frontend-source-card__file frontend-source-card__file--doc" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#document"></use></svg></span><span>May 14 · Google Docs</span></div><h2>Client Update — May 12</h2><p>Latest client update and upcoming milestones.</p><footer><span>Document</span><strong>••• +2</strong></footer></article><article class="frontend-source-card"><div class="frontend-source-card__top"><span class="frontend-source-card__file frontend-source-card__file--doc" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#document"></use></svg></span><span>May 14 · Google Docs</span></div><h2>Draft Agenda</h2><p>Proposed agenda and discussion topics for the meeting.</p><footer><span>Document</span><strong>••• +1</strong></footer></article><article class="frontend-source-card"><div class="frontend-source-card__top"><span class="frontend-source-card__file frontend-source-card__file--sheet" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#presentation"></use></svg></span><span>May 10 · Google Slides</span></div><h2>Q2 Roadmap</h2><p>Roadmap overview and delivery phases for Q2.</p><footer><span>Presentation</span><strong>••• +3</strong></footer></article></div>
        <section class="frontend-discover__network" aria-labelledby="network-discover-title"><div class="frontend-discover__network-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Nearby pulse</span><h2 id="network-discover-title">Explore the wider network</h2><p>Source-attributed discovery entities remain distinct from Kurukoo providers until they are claimed, verified and available.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/chat?prompt=Help%20me%20explore%20nearby">Open in Chat</a></div><div id="discover-map" class="discover-map-box" aria-label="Discovery network map"></div><div id="discover-list" class="k-list"><div class="k-row"><span>Locating useful discovery context…</span><span class="k-muted">Permission required</span></div></div><p class="discover-disclaimer">Privacy: location is coarse for discovery and map coordinates are fuzzed. Exact provider coordinates are never returned to the browser.</p></section>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css"><script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" crossorigin="" defer></script><script src="/js/kurukoo-discover-map.js" defer></script>
<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
